   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_09",
   "reference_only": true
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Doing okay, thanks.",
   "est_sec": 1.03,
   "gap_before": 0.54,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_03"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "My nephew is turning into a teenager and I have no clue what he likes anymore.",
   "est_sec": 5.06,
   "gap_before": 0.35,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "holiday_gifts.dlg3"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "That's a tough age to shop for. Gift cards are popular with teens because they get to choose.",
   "est_sec": 5.68,
   "gap_before": 1.09,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "holiday_gifts.dlg3",
   "reference_only": true
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Isn't a gift card kind of lazy, though?",
   "est_sec": 2.58,
   "gap_before": 0.69,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "holiday_gifts.dlg3"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Some people think so, but teens usually love them. Pair it with something small and fun so it feels personal.",
   "est_sec": 6.3,
   "gap_before": 0.56,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "holiday_gifts.dlg3",
   "reference_only": true
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Hold on, repeat that please.",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 2.34,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "kind": "wait_like",
   "phrasing": "waitlike_06",
   "block": "holiday_gifts.dlg3"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "No problem. Some people think so, but teens usually love them. Pair it with something small and fun so it feels personal.",
   "est_sec": 6.92,
   "gap_before": 0.43,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "holiday_gifts.dlg3",
   "reference_only": true
  },
  {
